, "contributor": null, "rationale": "When a rebuild disagrees with the record the finding is about the RECONSTRUCTION \u2014 but an unresolved discrepancy is an open defect to close, not to wave through."}, {"id": "recovered_handoff_11_register_append_only", "label": "The Register is append-only; a superseded entry is corrected by a new entry citing it", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "recovered/HANDOFF-11.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Never deleted, moved or renumbered \u2014 the superseded state stays legible."}, {"id": "recovered_handoff_11_no_silent_change_measured_diff", "label": "No silent change: every edit guarded by a measured diff", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "recovered/HANDOFF-11.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "difflib.unified_diff with PURE = 0 deletions; the guard IS the change certificate."}, {"id": "recovered_handoff_11_owed_register_expansions", "label": "OWED-REGISTER-EXPANSIONS.md", "file_type": "document", "source_file": "recovered/HANDOFF-11.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "recovered_handoff_11_owed_expansions_2", "label": "OWED-EXPANSIONS-2 (MC/PC/IoI work lists, empty of open work)", "file_type": "document", "source_file": "recovered/HANDOFF-11.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "recovered_handoff_11_stringpf_v_discrepancy", "label": "STRINGPF-V-DISCREPANCY.md \u2014 \u00a731.2.2 measured concave", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "recovered/HANDOFF-11.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Quarantined from the entry and flagged for M rather than asserted as an error: it needs the book's own d